data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_c1a1c63a-aa55-4457-96bb-29ba30070953","delta":"I've got your spending for this month, but I can't send the email yet — your Gmail account isn't connected. There should be a connect card here for you to link it; once it's connected, just ask again and I'll send the summary straight to your inbox.\n\nFor reference, here's what this month looks like:\n\n- Housing: $2,850.00\n- Subscriptions: $285.00\n- Dining: $87.00\n- **Total: $3,222.00**"}

